<title>UK: Lehman Bros set warrants on Roche Holding.</title>
<headline>Lehman Bros set warrants on Roche Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers International (Europe) has issued a total of 1.5 million American-style call warrants, on Roche Holding AG, lead manager Lehman Brothers Finance SA said.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    9000			PREMIUM	7.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     10.00 SFR		 GEARING	9.28 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.OCT.96-21.NOV.97   PAYDATE	21.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
